cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator, its parameters or derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "eq_simulator — Bucharest earthquake simulator (Re:Rise)"
abstract: "A bilingual web game module that simulates a Vrancea intermediate-depth earthquake in Bucharest: ground motion (H), vulnerability of the dupacutremur register and background stock (V), exposure of people, roads and emergency services (E), with explicit uncertainty (median and 10-90% band). The risk engine is a standalone TypeScript library."
authors:
